    "final_answer": "I have all the information I need. Let me summarize the findings:\n\n## Findings\n\nOn the US Apple Store (apple.com/shop/buy-ipad/ipad-mini):\n\n**Storage options for the current iPad mini:**\n- 128GB (starting at $599)\n- 256GB (starting at $699)\n- 512GB (starting at $899)\n\n**Connectivity options:**\n- Wi-Fi: starting at $599\n- Wi-Fi + Cellular: starting at $749\n\n## Answer\n\n**It is not possible to buy a 64GB iPad mini with Wi-Fi + Cellular connectivity.**\n\nApple's current iPad mini (A17 Pro, released October 2024) **does not come in 64GB storage**. The smallest storage configuration available is **128GB**. Apple discontinued the 64GB option when they refreshed the iPad mini lineup.\n\nIf you want the closest equivalent configuration — an iPad mini with the smallest storage (128GB) and Wi-Fi + Cellular connectivity — the price is **$749 USD** (or $62.41/month for 12 months). This includes no engraving, no Apple Pencil, no Smart Folio, and no Apple Trade-in, as you requested.\n\nIf the 64GB configuration is specifically required, you would need to look at a refurbished or older model iPad mini (6th generation or earlier) that was sold with 64GB storage. However, that older model is no longer available for purchase directly through Apple's main store.",
